        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 5000-353, 3-1/2\" x 3\"  Steel Hinges</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes one (1) complete hinge with matching finish steel flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws and 10-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. Standard full mortise hinge with 5 knuckle design and button tips. BHMA certified architectural grade hinges. Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/bommer-5000-353-hinge_size.gif?v=1704442266\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer 5000-353 Hinge Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 5000-353 Steel Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.123\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified Hinge</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Rising Removable Steel Pin</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - Conforms to ANSI A8133 Hinges</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/5000-353.pdf?v=1691094996\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 5000-353 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with matching finish machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/hinges\">Door Hinges</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
